a0 Make sure to leave no tomb unturned as you search the mansion for valuable clues and life saving supplies.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Rituals:</strong> Complete intricate <strong>Ritual Rune and Investigative Puzzles</strong> to push the investigation forward. Your stats determine your safety net... fail the ritual, and the Mansion\u2019s malice grows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/f22955628d77e118887578e2f03ab992.poster.avif?t=1773436502\" width=998 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/f22955628d77e118887578e2f03ab992.webm?t=1773436502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/f22955628d77e118887578e2f03ab992.mp4?t=1773436502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comic-Style Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the shadows lunge, the game shifts into a tabletop inspired, stylized narrative encounter. Choose how to react to every monster attack, but be careful, your success is dictated by each investigator's unique build and even the best laid plans can go awry with just a few bad choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/7790cf119ed6cbccb74e11341838bc35.poster.avif?t=1773436502\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/7790cf119ed6cbccb74e11341838bc35.webm?t=1773436502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/7790cf119ed6cbccb74e11341838bc35.mp4?t=1773436502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Can Be Prepared, But You Will Never Be Ready...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources you gather from successful investigations to buy permanent upgrades and crafting blueprints that will better help your chances of surviving within The Mansion... a bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/636617f9e41788d1166c96765f528a44.poster.avif?t=1773436502\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/636617f9e41788d1166c96765f528a44.webm?t=1773436502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/636617f9e41788d1166c96765f528a44.mp4?t=1773436502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access: Our Commitment to Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinite Mansion</i> is the labor of a 5-person team. In this Early Access version, we use AI-assisted placeholder art for our narrative popup panels to help portray our creative vision on an indie budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Promise:</strong> We are 100% committed to human artistry. All funds from Early Access are prioritized toward <strong>hiring professional human illustrators</strong> to replace every piece of placeholder art with custom, hand-drawn panels. Support us in building a masterpiece that honors the artists who inspire us.</p>","developers":["Noreasta Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.a